# A dead-letter append that failed is reported as a diversion.
MODULE: AckedResolvedFailedAppendAcknowledged
TARGET: AckedResolved
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a failed dead-letter append is acknowledged as diverted
PERTURBS: DeadLetter

--- FIND
    /\ IF r = "Ok" THEN Acknowledge(cur) ELSE FailAttempt
    /\ UNCHANGED <<val, late, pol, seen, judged, lostLeft, stored, storedUnder, parked>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF r # "Lost" THEN Acknowledge(cur) ELSE FailAttempt
    /\ UNCHANGED <<val, late, pol, seen, judged, lostLeft, stored, storedUnder, parked>>
--- END